{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16840","headline":"赠窦五判官 · 韦渠牟","name":"赠窦五判官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故旧相逢三两家，爱君兄弟有声华。\n文辉锦彩珠垂露，逸兴江天绮散霞。\n美玉自矜频献璞，真金难与细披沙。\n终须撰取新诗品，更比芙蓉出水花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦渠牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}